<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever sells desserts maker.</title>
<headline>Unilever sells desserts maker.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever NV said on Thursday its frozen foods subsidiary Ola-Iglo had completed the the sale of its Den Hartog icecream and desserts plant in Melissant to Koninklijke Brinker of Zoetermeer.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details of the transaction.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Unilever's Iglo-Ola will transfer Den Hartog's icecream-making activities to its plant in Wilp.</p>
<p>The Melissant operations will become part of Brinker's cake and confectionery division and concentrate on the manufacture of cream-based puddings and other desserts.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
